<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IBP Inc downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IBP Inc downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette analyst William Leach said he downgraded meat processor IBP Inc on Monday to a market performer from a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- He said tighter cattle supplies likely will not impact 1997 operations, but &quot;bodes poorly for 1998 and beyond.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Leach cut his fiscal 1998 earnings estimate to $2.00 a share from $2.70. His 1997 estimate remains $2.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- IBP shares were unchanged at $23.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
